WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.740
Two brothers, side by side.

2
00:00:02.790 --> 00:00:03.880
Same father.

3
00:00:03.930 --> 00:00:05.330
Same castle.

4
00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:08.190
One label for the elder: legitimate.

5
00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:10.610
One for the younger: base.

6
00:00:10.660 --> 00:00:12.710
The land goes to the elder.

7
00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:15.490
Alone, the younger holds up a letter.

8
00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:18.800
"Thou, Nature, art my goddess;" he says.

9
00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:21.120
"I grow, I prosper."

10
00:00:21.170 --> 00:00:25.340
So is Edmund a born villain,
or did his world make him one?

11
00:00:25.390 --> 00:00:27.960
In this mission, you'll
meet the Gloucester family,

12
00:00:28.010 --> 00:00:31.110
and the law that gave
all the land to one son.

13
00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:35.910
You'll take apart Edmund's soliloquy,
and his fury at one small word.

14
00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:39.210
And you'll watch him play a
different part for every victim,

15
00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:41.010
while confiding in you.

16
00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:44.430
Your mission: decide whether
Edmund was born a villain,

17
00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:45.500
or made one.
